            <particDesc>
                <p>A Sasanian official writes to another, perhaps lower-ranking official, invoking the authority of <persName ref="people:Dur001">Shapur</persName>.</p>
                <p>The letter could be dated to about 253 CE based on the known dates of the Sasanian siege and occupation of Dura-Europos</p>
            </particDesc>
            <creation>
                <!-- <date when="0000-00-00" calendar="#Pahlavi"></date> -->
                <date when="0253" calendar="#Julian">Approx. 253 CE</date>
            </creation>
