    <text>
        <body>
            <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
                <pb n="1" xml:id="pb-1r-trl" facs="beinecke:33188301"/>
                <ab xml:id="MP6000_trl-p1">
                    <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>
                    <damage extent="unclear"/> <unclear reason="illegible" extent="unclear"/>y ŠRM ʿS(G)D(H) (K)BYR ŠDRWN (K)Lʾ W-KʿT
                    <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>ʾw]gwn ls(y)[k] (W-ʿBDk) ? ʿB(Y)DWN . . . <damage extent="unclear"/>
                    <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>] ʾDYNcyt (YM)LLWN ʾYK c. <damage extent="unclear"/>
                    <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>c](y)gwn dpy-I (MN) ? <persName ref="people:Dur001">šḥpwḥ[ry</persName>
                    <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>
                    <persName>š](ḥ)pwḥry</persName> ʿL (m)<damage extent="unclear"/>
                    <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>Y[ḤBWN (ʾY)K ? LY <damage extent="unclear"/>
                    <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>ʾ]ynyʾ [Z]K? ʾ<damage extent="unclear"/>
                    <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>
                    <damage extent="unclear"/>L(y) (W)-L[K ?
                </ab>
                <pb n="2" xml:id="pb-1v-trl" facs="beinecke:33188308"/>
                <ab xml:id="MP6000_154_trl-p2">
                    <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p2-l1"/>ʿL (D)krytk lwny bʾly YḤ(YT)YW [
                    <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p2-l2"/>LʿYTY KʿNm MNDʿM ŠDRWN ZY[
                    <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p2-l3"/>ʾYK LY MNDʿM ḤWH ʾplw(l)[
                    <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p2-l4"/>PW(N) [Ḥ]Nʾ kʾly ʾynyʾ ḥ.[
                    <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p2-l5"/>
                    <gap/>
                    <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p2-l6"/>?pʾ]lswmy gwn(d)[ ?
                    <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p2-l7"/>
                    <gap/>
                </ab>
            </div>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
                <ab xml:id="MP6000_154_trans-p1">
                    <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>“...greetings, homage, much sent (to) all. And now; —
                    <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>... so servants and slaves (?) did ...
                    <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>... then further you said that ...
                    <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>...whereas a rescript from Shapur...
                    <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>...Shapur to M...
                    <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>...gave [instructions?] that I...
                    <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>...apart from ... that ...
                    <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>...I and you (?) ...”
                </ab>
                 <ab xml:id="MP6000_154_trans-p2">
                    <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p2-l1"/>“Bring the load towards the Tigris...
                    <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p2-l2"/>there is not. Now send me something that...
                    <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p2-l3"/>where there be something of mine, as extra-load (?)...
                    <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p2-l4"/>apart from [that which is] herein required...
                    <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p2-l5"/>
                    <gap/>
                    <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p2-l6"/>...the chief (?) army-corps (?)...
                    <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p2-l7"/>
                    <gap/>
                </ab>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
